<div class="gd-static-lead">
  <p><strong>The Global Desk</strong> is an independent digital news platform headquartered in Dhaka, Bangladesh. We cover South Asia, Asia and global affairs, helping readers understand important developments through news, research and analysis.</p>
</div>

<section class="gd-about-mission" aria-labelledby="about-mission-title">
  <span class="gd-static-eyebrow">Our mission</span>
  <h2 id="about-mission-title">Make the important understandable.</h2>
  <p>We aim to make complex developments easier to understand through clear reporting, useful context and thoughtful perspectives. We help readers look beyond headlines and understand why events matter.</p>
</section>

<section class="gd-static-section" aria-labelledby="about-coverage-title">
  <div class="gd-static-section__heading"><span class="gd-static-eyebrow">What we cover</span><h2 id="about-coverage-title">A wider view of the stories shaping our world</h2></div>
  <p>Our coverage includes international affairs, geopolitics, politics, economics, science, technology, the environment and human rights, with attention to developments across South Asia, Asia and the wider world.</p>
  <p>Our <strong>Research</strong> section focuses on research-driven journalism, evidence-based analysis, insights and context to help readers explore important issues in greater depth.</p>
</section>

<section class="gd-static-section" aria-labelledby="about-desks-title">
  <div class="gd-static-section__heading"><span class="gd-static-eyebrow">Our desks</span><h2 id="about-desks-title">News for readers at every stage</h2></div>
  <div class="gd-info-grid gd-info-grid--two">
    <article class="gd-info-item"><h3>Z Desk</h3><p>A dedicated editorial space for Generation Z, featuring relevant news, ideas and explainers on issues shaping young people’s lives and future.</p></article>
    <article class="gd-info-item"><h3>Alpha Desk</h3><p>Accessible, age-appropriate explanations and content that introduce younger audiences to news and important topics.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gd-about-values" aria-labelledby="about-values-title">
  <span class="gd-static-eyebrow">Our values</span>
  <h2 id="about-values-title">Accuracy. Clarity. Independence. Fairness. Transparency.</h2>
  <p>We aim to distinguish verified information from opinion and analysis, and provide the context readers need to form their own understanding.</p>
</section>
